r<\/b><\/h2>Configuraci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida y f\u00e1cil a trav\u00e9s de la aplicaci\u00f3n Mi Home\/Xiaomi Home. Botones f\u00e1ciles de usar y luces de notificaci\u00f3n interactivas para que toda la familia los use f\u00e1cilmente.<div><span style='background-color: initial;'><br><\/span><\/div><div><h2><span style='background-color: initial;'>Especificaciones<\/span><\/h2><ul style=''>  <li style=''><b>Peso del Producto:<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>460g<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Dimensiones (L\u00d7An\u00d7Al):<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>142 \u00d7 70 \u00d7 82 mm<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Botones<\/b>:<\/li>  <li style=''>Acci\u00f3n, Reproducir\/Pausar, Silenciar<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Conjunto de micr\u00f3fonos:<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>2 micr\u00f3fonos, con soporte de activaci\u00f3n de voz de campo lejano<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Altavoz<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>Altavoz de rango completo de 1,75'<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Conectividad:<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>IEEE 802.11 a\/b\/g\/n, 2,4 GHz\/5 GHz, BT 5.1 y A2DP<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n:<\/b><\/li>  <li style=''>12 V 1 A, entrada de CC<\/li>  <li style=''><b>Contenidos del paquete:<\/b><\/li>  <ul style=''>    <li style=''>Altavoz inteligente \u00d7 1<\/li>    <li style=''>Manual de usuario\u00d71<\/li>    <li style=''>Adaptador de corriente \u00d7 1<\/li><\/ul><\/ul><p><\/p><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"XIAOMI","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.62,"unit_price":29.91,"unit_price_tax":29.91,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Altavoces","sub_category":"Altavoces","quantity":5,"brand":"XIAOMI","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_xia-alt%20smt%20spk%20l_1.jpg"],"wh